/**
 * The help docs table of contents.
 *
 * GENERATED by `scripts/build-docs-catalog.mjs` from the markdown in
 * `site-docs/`. Do not edit: add or rename a file there and re-run
 * `npm run docs:catalog`. `tests/docs/catalog.test.ts` fails when this and
 * the markdown disagree.
 *
 * A constant rather than a directory walk because the docs sidebar is a client
 * component. Titles are each file's H1, so the navigation cannot name a doc
 * something the doc does not call itself.
 */

